# Identifiable user and operational flows.

```yaml
businessFlowsContext:
  businessFlows:
    - id: browse-portfolio-app
      name: Browse portfolio web application
      description: A visitor opens the home page, sees deployment status and application version, and can navigate to the About page.
      entryPoints:
        - "GET /"
        - "GET /about"
      criticality: medium
    - id: monitor-application-health
      name: Monitor application health
      description: Docker, CI, deployment automation, or an operator calls the health endpoint and expects a healthy JSON response.
      entryPoints:
        - "GET /health"
      criticality: high
    - id: automated-container-deployment
      name: Build and deploy a verified container
      description: A push to main runs tests, builds and publishes immutable and latest image tags, then deploys over SSH and rolls back after a failed health check.
      entryPoints:
        - ".github/workflows/ci.yml"
        - ".github/workflows/cd.yml"
        - "scripts/deploy.sh"
      criticality: high
```
